      "content": "the thing is, i don't think i can \"grow\" out of this. it feels like i've already seen my peak. i look back at my old stuff and it's like it was made by a different person. now i'm just a ghost of myself trying to write things i know i'll never be able to pull off again. it feels more like a slow decay than a block. if i keep going, i'm just going to turn into a parody of what i was.",
